TRANSLATION:
Tamam, {{TAG:0005:0001:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bir şey yakalamak
istiyorsan kafanı boşaltman lazım.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Odaaaaklan.

Bir balık tutarsam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ızgara mı
yapsam yoksa evcil hayvan mı yapsam?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Zor karar.

IT:
Stasera mi sa che per cena
ci sarà pesce alla griglia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
Ich hoffe, dass es gebratenen Fisch
zum Abendessen gibt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Los, ihr Fischlein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beißt endlich!

ES:
¡Una sopita de pescado me haría
todo un apaño esta noche,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
Stasera pesce al cartoccio!
Pancia mia fatti capanna,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
